      "items": [
        {
          "title": "球形住宅",
          "content": "<p>1968年，荷兰政府决定资助一个廉价住宅实验，最后选中了“球形住宅”设计。</p>\n<p>1980年，球形住宅区在登博斯市动工，最终造出了一个奇特的居民小区，好像外星人建筑。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091901.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091902.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>每栋住宅就是一个水泥的球体，并用玻璃纤维加固，安装在圆柱体的底座上。每个球体的直径为5.5米，每栋建筑共有11个圆窗。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091903.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091904.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>整个小区由50座球形住宅组成。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091905.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091910.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>每栋住宅内部，有一间浴室和一间小卧室，客厅和厨房位于二楼。它的优势是可以完全拆卸，整体运输到其他地方，甚至可以放置在水上。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091907.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091908.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>可以想象，当地人并不喜欢住在这种房子里面。但是，它吸引了很多游客来参观，成为当地的一个景点。游客甚至愿意付费体验一下，住在这种未来派房屋的感觉。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091909.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091911.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091912.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091913.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "球形住宅",
              "url": "https://unusualplaces.org/bolwoningen-neighborhood-of-spherical-homes/"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091901.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091902.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091903.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091904.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091905.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091910.jpg",
            "https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202109/bg2021091907.jpg",
